$ pace client add acme --currency EUR --rate 95.555   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `--rate "95.555"` doesn't fit: `95.555` is not an amount in EUR: write an amount in EUR with at most 2 decimals, like `95.50`
  help: give `--rate` another value, or leave the flag out


$ pace client add acme --currency EURO   # at 09:01
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `--currency "EURO"` doesn't fit: `EURO` is not an ISO 4217 currency code: did you mean `EUR`?
  help: give `--currency` another value, or leave the flag out


$ pace client add acme --currency EUR --rounding-step 0m   # at 09:02
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `--rounding-step "0m"` doesn't fit: the duration `0m` is not positive: give a duration longer than zero, like `15m`
  help: give `--rounding-step` another value, or leave the flag out


$ pace client add acme --from 2026-11-01   # at 09:03
success: false
exit_code: 2
